000001 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000002 PROGRAM-ID. PAYCALC.
000003 AUTHOR. PAYROLL TEAM.
000004*SYNTHETIC TEST PROGRAM FOR THE CHANGEPROOF COBOL ADAPTER
000005 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000006 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000007 FILE-CONTROL.
000008     SELECT PAY-FILE ASSIGN TO PAYIN.
000009 DATA DIVISION.
000010 FILE SECTION.
000011 FD  PAY-FILE.
000012 01  PAY-REC                 PIC X(80).
000013 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000014     COPY PAYWS.
000015 01  WS-RATE-TABLE.
000016     05  WS-RATE             PIC 9(3)V99 OCCURS 12 TIMES.
000017 01  WS-HASH-SVC             PIC X(8) VALUE 'CSNBOWH'.
000018 01  WS-DIGEST               PIC X(32).
000019 01  WS-NOTE        PIC X(40) VALUE 'CONTINUED LITERAL THAT RUNS
000020-    'PAST ONE LINE'.
000021 LINKAGE SECTION.
000022 01  LK-EMP-ID               PIC 9(6).
000023 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-EMP-ID.
000024 MAIN-PARA.
000025     PERFORM CALC-PARA
000026     CALL 'PAYAUDIT' USING WS-TOTAL
000027     CALL WS-HASH-SVC USING WS-TOTAL, WS-DIGEST
000028D    DISPLAY 'DEBUG ONLY'
000029     STOP RUN.
000030 CALC-SECTION SECTION.
000031 CALC-PARA.
000032     COPY PAYRULE REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==WS==
000033                            ==BONUS-RATE== BY ==WS-RATE (1)==.
000034     EXEC SQL
000035         SELECT HASH_SHA256(EMP_NAME) INTO :WS-DIGEST
000036         FROM EMPLOYEE WHERE EMP_ID = :LK-EMP-ID
000037     END-EXEC
000038     EXEC CICS LINK PROGRAM('PAYLOG') END-EXEC
000039     CALL 'CSNDDSG' USING WS-DIGEST.
